Godblood is [[Org/Sedecium|Sedecium]]'s name for the fuel that drives its ships and works, a bright icy blue liquid that freezes the air around it and eats the insulation from any wire it touches. It is synthetic, made without a god to bleed, and Sedecium takes it on at fuel depots rather than making it. A pipe carrying it runs through the maintenance level of the [[Geography/Færrin/Infinite Horizon/Far Realms/Hesperid|Hesperid]], where it burst and blocked the way.
